# Machine-specific Gradle daemon JVM criteria (generated by Android Studio's
# updateDaemonJvm). Must NOT be committed — it pins a local JDK vendor/version
# that breaks CI on other platforms. The daemon JVM is driven by the
# environment's JDK (CI: setup-java; local: your JAVA_HOME); toolchains resolve
# via the Foojay convention plugin in settings.gradle.kts.
/gradle/gradle-daemon-jvm.properties
